fastMD contains namespaced inference code migrated from MatRIS-09bk branches:
- MatRIS (main): BSD-3-Clause; see licenses/matris.txt.
- CHGNet (origin/CHGNet_CG): see licenses/chgnet.txt.
- ALIGNN (origin/ALIGNN_CG): see licenses/alignn.txt.

Exact source commits and migrated paths are recorded in docs/sources.json.
CHGNet 0.3.0 pretrained weights are retained from the CHGNet branch.
Other model weights are supplied by the user or downloaded by the MatRIS loader.
The original licenses, attributions and applicable model/data terms continue to apply.
The new fastMD interface code is distributed under the BSD-3-Clause license in LICENSE.
TorchSim is an architectural reference, not a runtime dependency or vendored source.
